    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131">

                <pb facs="0232" n="212" xml:id="pg212"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/6–2850: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-06-28T14:00:00+03:00">June 28, 1950—2 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 28—8:56 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">JUNE 28, 1950</p>
                <p rendition="#center">(Wednesday)</p>
                <p>1754. Embassy welcomes public announcement re Korea by President noting
                    modifications original statement contained Deptel 541,<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d131-f1"/> June 27. In our view this firm stand exactly what is
                    necessary to serve notice to Soviets that Communists have gone too far. Needless
                    to say US action will prove tremendous influence all areas threatened by
                    Communist aggression, and effects in Asia should become manifest shortly.</p>
                <p>Repeated information London 264, Paris 251, USUN
                    44, Tokyo 26, Department pass London, Paris, USUN, Tokyo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d131-f1" n="1" xml:id="d131-f1-content">
                <p>Telegram 3124, June 27, 1 a. m., to London, <ref target="#pg186">p. 186</ref>,
                    was repeated to Moscow as telegram 541.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
